 "sentences": [
  "Mars is hiding strange, light-colored rocks.",
  "Perseverance found these boulders beyond Jezero crater.",
  "Most Martian rocks are dark basalt, making these stand out.",
  "Data shows they are igneous gabbro, formed by cooling magma deep underground.",
  "The rover is now investigating nearby breccia to see if these rocks eroded from it.",
  "Asteroid impacts might be responsible for digging them up."
